    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gatdɛ ni Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ, kä cuɛ rɔ jak kä bum kɛ thuk duëli kuec caam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wi̱i̱ Juda diaal tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m moc kɛ rɛm, cuɛ kɛ moc amäni wi̱i̱ tëë ci gua̱n ni Atha kɛ käp rɛy cieŋ Juda kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ Ɛ-pa-rim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuoth Nhial te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ, kɛ ɣöö cɛ guɔ̱r ni duɔ̱p gua̱n ëë nhiam. Kä /kenɛ kuoth Baal pal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ pal ni Kuoth gua̱ni, kä cuɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni dupkɛ kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱tkɛ a /ci mɔ a duɔ̱ɔ̱p thuk duëli kuec caam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cu Kuoth Nhial kuäär la̱th tetädɛ, kä cua luɔ̱ny tho̱lbo̱k ɛ ji̱ Juda diaal. Kä cuɛ tekɛ ria̱ŋ mi di̱i̱t kɛnɛ luth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ lɔcdɛ ka̱m Kuoth Nhial, kä cuɛ gua̱th palä kuthni guäyni kɛ kuoth Ä-ce-rim da̱k piny kä Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gɔɔy Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k runi ruëc Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat, cuɛ kua̱r kɔaarɛ ni Bɛn-ɣɛ̈-yil kɛnɛ O-bad-yaa kɛ Dhɛ-kar-yaa kɛnɛ Nɛ-tan-el kɛ Mi-ka-yaa Ja̱k, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ wä ŋi̱eec wi̱i̱ni Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wä kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay ni, Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa kɛnɛ Nɛ-thɛ̈n-yaa kɛ Dhɛ-bɛ̈d-yaa kɛnɛ Ä-tha-el kɛ Cɛ-mi-ra-moth kɛnɛ Yɛ-ɣo-na-than kɛ Ä-do-ni-yaa kɛnɛ To-bi-yaa kɛ Tob-ä-do-ni-yaa kɛ bööth palä ni, Ɛli-cama kɛnɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ bok ŋuɔ̱tni Kuɔth Nhial naŋ, kä cukɛ jɛ wä ŋi̱eec ni nɛy diaal rɛy ciëëŋni Juda diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kua̱r diaal tin cieŋ wi̱i̱ni tin thieek kɛ Juda dual kɛ Kuoth Nhial, /ka̱n Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat lɛ mak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat nöŋ muc, kä cua nöŋ ciɛk in bo̱r ala tho̱lbo̱k. Kä cu ji̱ Ä-rab jɛ nöŋ rueeth deet ti bathdɔɔri bärɔw wi̱cdɛ kur bärɔw, kɛ näc deet ti bathdɔɔri bärɔw wi̱cdɛ kur bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ buɔ̱m ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä cuɛ wi̱i̱ ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m kɛ wi̱i̱ tɔ̱ɔ̱wä täth kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ tekɛ mi̱th ti ŋuan rɛy ciëëŋni Juda. Kä cuɛ nɛy ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m ti ji̱ ko̱o̱r jak kä cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛmɛ ɛ pekdiɛn ce̱tnikɛ thuk duëli gua̱ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
